monst.c is very useful.  If you want to know which monsters use which
attacks, check it first.  The attacks are generally pretty
self-descriptive (AD_SPEL, AD_CLRC, AD_PHYS), but I wouldn't put AD_CURS
in that group, as it's not "cursing" as you think of it in nethack.  In
other words, if you don't check and see that it's an attack used only by
gremlins, it's very tough to guess what it really is.  

Then if you want to see what each attack does, there's mhitu.c, mhitm.c,
and mcastu.c, but I think you're familiar with those.

